janaza bhai hasan ka utha rahe hain hussain<br>
gham e firaaq me aansu baha rahe hain hussain<br>
<br>
hasan ko zehr se jaa'da ne kardiya hai shaheed<br>
sar apna peet ke sab ko bata rahe hain hussain<br>
<br>
tadapte rote bilakte yateem bachchau'n ko <br>
dilasa de ke gale se laga rahe hai'n hussain<br>
<br>
pachhade khati hai'n kulsoom roti hain zainab <br>
jo ghar se leke jananze ko jaa rahe hai'n hussain<br>
<br>
sitam ke teer baraste hai'n ab janaze par <br>
aur apne sabr ke jouhar dikha rahe hain hussain<br>
<br>
huwa hai aaj baradar juda mera mujhse <br>
tadapke sab ko ye nouha suna rahe hain hussain<br>
<br>
na dafn karne diya jab nabi ke pehlu me <br>
suwe baqee janaza bhadha rahe hain hussain<br>
<br>
zameen girya kuna hai falak larazta hai <br>
lahad me lashe baradar lita rahe hain hussain<br>
<br>
dua ye hai koi aaker kahe kamaal chalo <br>
mazaar par tumhe apni bula rahe hai hussain<br>
